
12 Dec 2025 -- need to free up that hailstone list

For some obscure reason I just had to put in a hailstone
tracking list. Try 100 000 000 for kicks to see the machine
grind. Be sure to time it.

----------------------------------------------------------------
       start   path_len    max_at             max  hailstone
----------------------------------------------------------------
 
           3          7         3              16          2
           7         16         5              52          5
           9         19         8              52          6
....
     8400511        685       190    159424614880        256
    11200681        688       193    159424614880        257
    14934241        691       196    159424614880        258
    15733191        704       209    159424614880        263
    36791535        744       249    159424614880        278
    63728127        949        74    966616035460        357

So there we see 63728127 will go up and down 357 times.

--------------------------------------------------------------
After a pile of messing around on 16 May 2021 we have a 
must better looking output and we track the hailstones :


mars$ ./collatz 8842233                                                                       
----------------------------------------------------------------
       start   path_len    max_at                 max  hailstone
----------------------------------------------------------------
     8842233        579       166      60342610919632        215
mars$ 

where : 

https://mathworld.wolfram.com/HailstoneNumber.html

be sure to look at 63728127 

